# Cline & Roo Code Project Rules
- Mandatory reading: AGENTS.md, Docs/rules.md, PROJECT_MEMORY.md.
- Maintain bilingual comments (Vietnamese + English) on all functions, classes, and components.
- Android Package Name: com.nextai.gameoffline (Publisher: NextAI Technology).
- Backend runs on Port 6033 with Swagger documentation at /api-docs.
- All 423 HTML5 games must be integrated smoothly into the Kotlin WebView shell.
- File locks are governed by .ai/locks.json.
- Always log activities into TASK_LOG.md.
